## Building and Running

This project is a **library-style class**, not a standalone program. Typical setup:

1. Place `StoutList.java` in:

   ```text
   src/edu/iastate/cs228/hw3/StoutList.java
   ```

2. Compile with:

   ```bash
   javac -d out src/edu/iastate/cs228/hw3/StoutList.java
   ```

3. Write your own `main` or JUnit tests that import and use:

   ```java
   import edu.iastate.cs228.hw3.StoutList;
   ```

   and run them from your IDE or command line.

